  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 890ab52acda4f5fcdf5830fffec0362b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Briefing2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TahaYasin.Runtime::PresidentialBriefingData
  briefingId: president_2
  afterScenario: 4
  heading: "SARSINTIDAN SONRA \u0130LK M\xDCDAHALE"
  dialogueLines:
  - "Sars\u0131nt\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda birka\xE7 saniye uzun gelir. O birka\xE7 saniyede verilen do\u011Fru y\xF6nlendirme, bir ailenin sonraki \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131y\u0131 yapabilmesini sa\u011Flar."
  - "\u0130\xE7erideyseniz g\xFCvenli bir noktada \xC7\xF6k-Kapan-Tutun yap\u0131n; ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ve boynunuzu koruyun. Sars\u0131nt\u0131 bitmeden merdivene y\xF6nelmeyin, asans\xF6r kullanmay\u0131n."
  - "Yaral\u0131ya ula\u015Fmakla enkazdaki insana ula\u015Fmak ayn\u0131 haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131 istemiyor. Mevcut ekiplere bakarak karar verin: kurtarma hatt\u0131n\u0131 m\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCtece\u011Fiz, sa\u011Fl\u0131k ve yang\u0131n m\xFCdahalesini mi g\xFC\xE7lendirece\u011Fiz?"
  planA:
    title: "ENKAZA ER\u0130\u015E\u0130M"
    rationale: "Ambulans deste\u011Fi azalt\u0131larak kurtarma hatt\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCt\xFCl\xFCr."
    ambulances: -2
    firefighters: 1
    thirdTeam: 4
  planB:
    title: "\u0130LK M\xDCDAHALE A\u011EI"
    rationale: "Kurtarma yede\u011Fi azalt\u0131l\u0131r; sa\u011Fl\u0131k ve yang\u0131n g\xFCc\xFC artar."
    ambulances: 3
    firefighters: 2
    thirdTeam: -2
  closing: "Tahsis y\xFCr\xFCrl\xFCkte. Her ekibi do\u011Fru ihtiya\xE7la bulu\u015Ftural\u0131m. Yeni \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131da karar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n sahadaki kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rece\u011Fiz."
  endsShift: 0
